      "content": "i know there are people to talk to, but that doesn't change the fact that i'm the one who built this. i'm the one who made these choices. every time i try to reach out, the weight of everything i've lost just hits me harder. it's like i've created this perfect, quiet prison for myself and now even the quiet is just... heavy. i don't want to talk my way out of it, i just feel like i'm stuck in a loop that has no exit.",
